<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>CI/CD on Onur Celep</title><link>https://onurcelep.github.io/tags/ci/cd/</link><description>Recent content in CI/CD on Onur Celep</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 09 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://onurcelep.github.io/tags/ci/cd/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>About</title><link>https://onurcelep.github.io/about/</link><pubDate>Fri, 09 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://onurcelep.github.io/about/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;I am a staff-level software engineer based in Berlin. Since 2013 I have built developer platforms, CI/CD systems, and test infrastructure for products at Mercedes-Benz, Intel, Ericsson, and trivago.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;My focus is the tooling that lets engineering organizations ship reliably: build and test pipelines, hardware-in-the-loop labs, and agent tooling that fits safely alongside them.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="experience"&gt;&#10; Experience&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#experience"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;dl&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.linutronix.de/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Linutronix (Intel)&lt;/a&gt;, since 2024&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Lead, freelance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://mbition.io/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Mbition (Mercedes-Benz)&lt;/a&gt;, 2022 - 2023&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://mbition.io/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Mbition (Mercedes-Benz)&lt;/a&gt;, 2020 - 2022&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer (DevOps)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.luxoft.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Luxoft&lt;/a&gt;, 2018 - 2020&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QA Automation Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.trivago.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;trivago&lt;/a&gt;, 2017 - 2018&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Developer in Test&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ericsson.com/en" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Ericsson&lt;/a&gt;, 2013 - 2017&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;/dl&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="open-source"&gt;&#10; Open Source&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#open-source"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;dl&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/onurcelep/labgrid-mcp" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;labgrid-mcp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;MCP server for hardware-in-the-loop device control.&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/onurcelep/ai-factory" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;ai-factory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;Agent-ready repository setup for Claude Code.&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/onurcelep/picokvm-client" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;picokvm-client&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;Python client for the Luckfox PicoKVM.&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;/dl&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="tools"&gt;&#10; Tools&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#tools"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Python, Java, Groovy, C#, Bash, C&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Services</title><link>https://onurcelep.github.io/services/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://onurcelep.github.io/services/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Consulting, architecture review, and hands-on implementation, backed by engineering work at Mercedes-Benz, Intel, and Ericsson since 2013.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;dl&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;svg class="layer-group icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"&gt;&lt;!--! Font Awesome Free 6.2.1 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) Copyright 2022 Fonticons, Inc. --&gt;&lt;path d="M264.5 5.2c14.9-6.9 32.1-6.9 47 0l218.6 101c8.5 3.9 13.9 12.4 13.9 21.8s-5.4 17.9-13.9 21.8l-218.6 101c-14.9 6.9-32.1 6.9-47 0L45.9 149.8C37.4 145.8 32 137.3 32 128s5.4-17.9 13.9-21.8L264.5 5.2zM476.9 209.6l53.2 24.6c8.5 3.9 13.9 12.4 13.9 21.8s-5.4 17.9-13.9 21.8l-218.6 101c-14.9 6.9-32.1 6.9-47 0L45.9 277.8C37.4 273.8 32 265.3 32 256s5.4-17.9 13.9-21.8l53.2-24.6 152 70.2c23.4 10.8 50.4 10.8 73.8 0l152-70.2zm-152 198.2l152-70.2 53.2 24.6c8.5 3.9 13.9 12.4 13.9 21.8s-5.4 17.9-13.9 21.8l-218.6 101c-14.9 6.9-32.1 6.9-47 0L45.9 405.8C37.4 401.8 32 393.3 32 384s5.4-17.9 13.9-21.8l53.2-24.6 152 70.2c23.4 10.8 50.4 10.8 73.8 0z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt; Platform Engineering &amp;amp; Developer Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;Internal platforms, tooling, and workflows for engineering teams.&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;svg class="sitemap icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"&gt;&lt;!--! Font Awesome Free 6.2.1 by @f